01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1LqDaPNr0KEQ7kNvwGiCl-e&_nc_oc=Adr30kPfBFRqhUWYjmfyYPFWn8y65BX9s-_wAfPNHzA280v5F-BAbwMex9phRJ6wpVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-82ES41lLEfw1JlCQ0YdVcjGJYZO6qeX9a0_vaYJPUlA&oe=6A28347D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RUXpfYYpHNsQ7kNvwGSxnAc&_nc_oc=AdqV8Dv2IjVX0RYeQ_bGA_8tK_TiQ9bIcLiOXVbUzJ6pB1CAj4a2t0ZprpZld_wYjTI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-aKEZ7x7gyuobSqmzu1FqOTm5ELB9hsc8ksG7tag0ijQ&oe=6A281ABB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C-2MlrI1U8oQ7kNvwFkjquY&_nc_oc=AdplDEBYSW_A1-k0CuVL6QydNqqqZI0pFWXD3hnWPtBHn5a1z9UVxwj4EA_IummQ8x0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_CpYe4kIs4utHmnIaEKOyUULBmv5G9Rkv6A0bqTtaPug&oe=6A282FE5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a